10:T7aa,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://nevadesign.fr"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Solutions","item":"https://nevadesign.fr/#solutions"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"FiveM Logo Maker","item":"https://nevadesign.fr/en/fivem-logo-maker"}]},{"@type":"Service","name":"FiveM Logo Maker","description":"Design a custom FiveM server logo from a text description. Crest, mascot or neon styles, 8K export. No credit card required.","url":"https://nevadesign.fr/en/fivem-logo-maker","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Neva Design","url":"https://nevadesign.fr"},"areaServed":"Worldwide"},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes a logo work in the FiveM server browser?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Contrast and silhouette. Players scroll a dense, dark list where your mark renders tiny; a bold shape with two or three strong colors survives, while thin lines and subtle gradients turn to mush. Test every candidate at thumbnail size on a dark background before committing — thirty seconds that save a rebrand."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can it produce matching logos for our factions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, and that is where description-based generation shines. Reuse the city brief and change only the subject: same palette and construction for PD, EMS or a gang crest with its own attitude. The family resemblance reads as an organized city, which whitelist applicants notice."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You choose: the €19 identity pack if you only came for the logo, a subscription from €24/month if the server needs regular art, or one-off €2.90 top-ups. Nothing renews silently, and pricing sits on /#pricing. Your finished exports remain yours either way."}}]}]}a:["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","st